      "title": "Critical Playback Control Bugs",
      "kind": "pain_point",
      "theme_id": "spotify-t33",
      "body": "The 'Playback Stops Unexpectedly' theme is the largest pain point with 2,743 mentions and a 99.5% negative sentiment share [#rv_3749779709334236975] [#rv_-5700067493002022049]. Users report that playback controls and the 'Now Playing' bar frequently disappear, forcing them to close the app to stop music [#rv_-6984786771669701712] [#rv_7445841060292801067]. This issue is particularly disruptive during activities like driving or working out where manual intervention is difficult [#rv_-6984786771669701712]."
    },
    {
      "title": "Rising Ad Fatigue for Free Users",
      "kind": "pain_point",
      "theme_id": "spotify-t34",
      "body": "Complaints about ad frequency have surged by 29.2%, with 1,858 users citing 'Ads Every Few Songs' as a major frustration [#rv_4798359568287320618] [#rv_-8733108725390943787]. Many users report experiencing up to seven or eight consecutive ads, which significantly degrades the listening experience [#rv_6262001902012044143] [#rv_-8496883486579750352]. This growing dissatisfaction threatens retention among the free tier user base who feel the service is no longer worth the intrusion [#rv_4798359568287320618]."
    },
    {
      "title": "Unexpected Song Playback Errors",
      "kind": "emerging",
      "theme_id": "spotify-t37",
      "body": "The 'Unexpected Song Playback' theme is the fastest-growing issue, increasing by 36.2% with 1,260 reports of high negative sentiment [#rv_4877225128663681837] [#rv_-7589450099845676560]. Users are increasingly frustrated when the app plays random or unrelated tracks instead of the specific song they selected [#rv_1948492864084987853] [#rv_3330890961785893525]. This behavior undermines user trust in the app's core functionality of playing chosen content [#rv_3951220823307123972]."
    },
    {
      "title": "Strong Music Discovery Praise",
      "kind": "praise",
      "theme_id": "spotify-t16",
      "body": "The 'Positive Music Discovery Praise' theme is the most cited positive aspect, with 3,484 mentions and only a 3.6% negative share [#rv_1721752527725228387] [#rv_2538998931230266096]. Users consistently highlight the app's ability to introduce them to new artists and maintain a comprehensive library [#rv_4176098858478520566] [#rv_493402585302602664]. This strong sentiment indicates that the recommendation engine remains a key differentiator and retention driver [#rv_5319561742467600702]."
    }
  ]
